cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the article and the software."
title: "CSL2 — Legitimacy-Gated Social Learning"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation and replication package for "Endogenous Legitimacy in
  Social Learning": an agent-based model in which reward feedback teaches only
  through an endogenous legitimacy gate, fairness is judged against a
  transmissible modal-agent benchmark, and legitimacy is a self-reinforcing
  attitude yielding a behavioural-equilibrium fold with hysteresis.
type: software
